    "reviews_section_7Waym": {
      "type": "reviews-section",
      "blocks": {
        "review_Wjf7Pg": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Sarah M",
            "date": "01/01/2026",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p><br/>Absolutely love this nursing pillow! The quality is amazing, and changing to a plastic buckle makes it so much easier and more secure to use. Highly recommended for new moms!<br/><br/></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/vghh.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_nyBfQP": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Ashley Wilson",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>The cushioning feels soft and supportive. It's a lovely addition to my baby's feeding essentials</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_a5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Ashley T.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>Feeding sessions used to leave my shoulders and neck so sore, but this pillow lifts baby to the perfect latch height effortlessly. The 3-point support really takes the pressure off my arms. The strap takes a second to adjust, but it’s a total lifesaver for long nursing sessions!</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/https_3A_2F_2Fnuzzlenestbed.com_2Fcdn_2Fshop_2Ffiles_2FIMG_4412_246fcbed-7429-4b2b-9ee1-3d63afb91559.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_a4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Jessica T.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>Super comfortable, breathable, and so easy to clean after our trip. My baby slept like a rock at 30,000 feet. Highly recommended for flying parents!</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/dsfgf_2157dcbd-ea05-463f-9f5c-764f2a257b82.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_a2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Laura K.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>The 100% cotton cover feels super gentle on my baby's sensitive skin, and the pearl cotton filling holds its shape well without flattening out. The zipper can be a bit tight to zip back on after washing, but overall it's a very solid and well-made pillow.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/photo_2026-10-12_17-37-59_5f7c1079-aa70-4b77-8c65-2deda147a75a.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_8XVNjh": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Sarah Thompson",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>I love the adjustable strap. It makes the pillow easier to position during feeding</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_MhztXn": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Jessica Miller",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>The whale pattern is absolutely adorable! The colors are soft and look beautiful in person.</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_Htfcha": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Emily Carter",
            "date": "01/01/2026",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p><br/>This pillow provides extra support while I'm feeding my baby. I love how comfortable it feels!</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_a1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Emily R.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>We took a 12-hour flight with our 4-month-old, and this pillow saved my arms! Baby slept peacefully for hours, and I finally got to rest too.</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_a3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "David K.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>I used to get severe shoulder pain holding our baby during red-eye flights. With this strap system, my baby slept peacefully the whole flight and I could finally close my eyes and rest.</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_wch9ap": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Megan R.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>The pearl cotton filling is nice and firm, so baby doesn't sink down while nursing. It holds baby securely at an angle that helped reduce spit-ups during bottle feeding too. The cotton cover is super breathable, though zipping it back on after washing is a bit tight. Very happy with it!</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_cUryjU": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 4,
            "author": "Nicole B.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>Having the strap keep the pillow snug against my waist means I don't have to keep readjusting it mid-feed. It gives my back much-needed relief during late-night nursing sessions. Solid quality and very soft fabric for baby's skin!</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_ra6AQV": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Laura K.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>This pillow has been a daily lifesaver for bottle feeding at home. The 3-point support takes all the weight off my arms while sitting on the couch. The cotton cover is super soft, though zipping it back on after washing requires a little patience. Overall, a very solid purchase!</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Create_realistic_product_review___20261020081526.jpg"
          }
        }
      },
